Multi-line headings

```
# Title
outside
.
<section id="Title-outside">
  <h1>Title
outside</h1>
</section>
```

```
## A
## still A
# B
.
<section id="A-still-A">
  <h2>A
still A</h2>
</section>
<section id="B">
  <h1>B</h1>
</section>
```

```
# Title
- item
.
<section id="Title">
  <h1>Title</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>item</li>
  </ul>
</section>
```

```
# Title
1. one
.
<section id="Title">
  <h1>Title</h1>
  <ol>
    <li>one</li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
